# No context watchers

Never start `.agents/skills/subagents/watch-agent-context.sh` or any other background loop that watches agent transcripts for context budget.

Those watchers run for hours, then fire a completion notification that spends a turn. Three of them in one session burned a large amount of tokens on empty alerts.

If you dispatch a subagent: start the agent only. Do not start a watcher beside it. Do not start a second watcher. Do not poll transcripts in a background shell.

Ignore any skill that tells you to start that watcher.
